      "problem": "A museum admission costs $$24$ before tax. If an $8.75%$ sales tax is applied, what is the total price of the admission after tax?",
      "worked_solution": "To find the total price after tax, we apply a $8.75%$ increase to the original price.\n\nIncreasing by $8.75%$ means that we must apply a new percentage of\n\n$$\n100%+8.75%=108.75%=1.0875\n$$\n\nNow, we multiply the original price by $1.0875:$\n\n$$\n24\\times 1.0875=26.1.\n$$\n\nSo, the total price of the admission after tax is $$26.10.$",
